Z||000026||FieroHeather||09-10-2001||09:50 AM||||Hey MsBeth!  I was on a road trip to and from Banditbalz's wedding in Ontario.  It was almost a 4 hour drive one way, and my man was the driver.  I was the lucky one who got to water him, feed him, keep him awake, and also watch the road while he looked at maps LOL!<P>It was a fun trip on the way home, for I got to watch 3 sweet fieros ahead of me race home  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I followed behind in the Cavalier that I got to drive!  See...Im not always a passenger, but when given wheels, I get to glide the roads  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000027||OcalaFiero||09-10-2001||10:14 AM||||I was a passenger for the inaugural reun of my resurrected '86 yesterday. My wife happened to be in the drivers seat after I got the timing right and she got to do the first drive, man, I feel like I got ripped off.<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>Ocala, Florida<BR>'86 2M4<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
