Z||000030||Butter||09-10-2001||10:45 AM||||1st Rule for my passengers:<BR>Get in sit down shut up and hang on.<P>2nd Rule:<BR>Get acclimated and relax.<P>3rd Rule:<BR>Positive contributions are welcomed and will yield positive driving results, negative contributions are not welcomed and will negative driving results up to the point of "Get Out Now!"<P>Those rules have worked for me now for 21 years.  Even my dog loves to ride with me.||||reg||1
